cution evidence is documented with an executable acquisition plan.\n\nValidation: 36 scenarios, 19 tests per normal/repeat/optimized run, three external signatures cross-checked by Node/Python, 14 isolated source mutations killed and zero survived/crashed. The same-evidence component baseline falsely authorizes 21/32 negative/unsupported requests; explicit composition authorizes 0/32. Six unavailable integration boundaries remain outside mutation coverage. Historical v2 18/2 and follow-up 2/0 evidence remain unchanged.\n\nIncludes the formal model, prior-art analysis, academic paper draft, source/byte locks, raw command logs and pinned CI. No upstream vulnerability, general security guarantee or novelty claim is made.\n\nThis branch is based on unmerged draft PR #2 at 653b8e92e56afb99797c04b1c616a6d7fb3555e9; the main diff therefore includes that dependency. Review v3-only changes from that SHA. Keep this PR draft; do not merge automatically.\n","created_at":"2026-10-17T02:53:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T02:53:51Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"6762bb4b0d354198a3f5162a9656e2c9889a4791","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pulls/3/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pulls/3/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/issues/3/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pipavlo82/verifiable-ai-guarantee-composition/statuses/98ffba16730030c797c47766e13a5314181ba2f6","head":{"label":"pipavlo82:research/complete-real-evidence-chain-v3","ref":"research/complete-real-evidence-chain-v3","sha":"98ffba16730030c797c47766e13a5314181ba2f6","user